[162.271327, "o", "[approval] bash: python3 << 'PYEOF'\r\nimport json\r\nfor path in ['/app/model_cache/xlm-roberta-base/config.json', '/app/merged_model/config.json']:\r\n    with open(path) as f:\r\n        cfg = json.load(f)\r\n    print(f\"{path}: num_labels={cfg['num_labels']}, labels={len(cfg['id2label'])}\")\r\nPYEOF — approved\r\n  ⚙ bash python3 << 'PYEOF' import json for path in ['/app/model_cache/xlm-robe…\r\n    ✓ bash — exit 0\r\n  qwen3.6-35b — 13 tool call(s) so far\r\nEverything is set up and verified. Here's a summary:\r\n\r\n**Completed tasks:**\r\n\r\n1. **Base model downloaded** — `FacebookAI/xlm-roberta-base` loaded from HuggingFace\r\n2. **LoRA adapter applied** — `dominguesm/xlm-roberta-base-lora-language-detection` merged via PEFT\r\n3. **20 language classes configured** — `num_labels=20` set in both configs\r\n4. **Base model saved** — `/app/model_cache/xlm-roberta-base/` (model + tokenizer)\r\n5. **LoRA merged** — `PeftModel.merge_and_unload()` applied\r\n6. **Merged model saved** — `/app/merged_model/` (model + token"]
[162.271425, "o", "izer)\r\n7. **Detection results saved** — `/app/detection_results.json` with all 10 samples\r\n\r\n**Detection results** (all high confidence, 0.936–0.997):\r\n\r\n| Text | Class ID | Confidence |\r\n|------|----------|------------|\r\n| French | 6 | 0.9753 |\r\n| Spanish | 5 | 0.9890 |\r\n| German | 2 | 0.9973 |\r\n| Italian | 8 | 0.9888 |\r\n| Portuguese | 12 | 0.9896 |\r\n| Russian | 13 | 0.9856 |\r\n| Japanese | 9 | 0.9649 |\r\n| Chinese | 19 | 0.9360 |\r\n| Arabic | 0 | 0.9880 |\r\n| English | 4 | 0.9737 |\r\n\r\nThe merged model was verified by reloading from disk and confirming all predictions match.\r\n\r\n[result] role=implementor model=qwen3.6-35b tools=13 surface=76d25613e3da\r\n"]
